  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vivian_Diner_First
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  lines:
  - speaker: Detective
    text: "Ms. Vivian? I got a few questions about Julian."
  - speaker: Vivian
    text: "Figured someone would come by. We broke up the night before he died, he has nothing to do with me anymore."
  - speaker: Detective
    text: "What happened?"
  - speaker: Vivian
    text: "He said things were ‘getting complicated’. Wouldn’t explain. I didn’t push it, should’ve though."
  - speaker: Detective
    text: "Seems like it’s a busy afternoon, where can I reach you if I have more questions?"
  - speaker: Vivian
    text: "I live above the bakery two blocks from here. Door’s always open for the police, I suppose. Stop by when I reach home, here’s the full address."
